# Everything returns once Nowhere to Run has left. Bot1's Nowhere to Run kills Bot2's Ornithopter on turn three; on turn four
# Bot2 Disenchants it. On turn five Bot1's Lightning Bolt at Bot2's Sedgemoor Witch (Ward - Pay 3 life) triggers the Witch's ward
# again: Bot1 pays 3 life (20 to 17) and the Bolt resolves and kills the Witch. (The same Bolt with the enchantment out is
# scenario nowhere-to-run-ward-of-an-opponents-creature-does-not-trigger: no payment, 20 life.)

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Nowhere to Run
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mox Jet
Mox Emerald
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Sedgemoor Witch
Ornithopter
Disenchant
Island x12

